Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.10,0:00:03.05,Note,,0,0,0,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.05,0:00:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,什么样的怪物会喜欢处女和金子\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of thing likes virgins and gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.07,0:00:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.14,0:00:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,是龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dragons,dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.22,0:00:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.16,0:00:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是觉得 最好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just think it's better if.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.95,0:00:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took it easy,you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.95,0:00:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,别像是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And didn't act like you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.42,0:00:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,被天使附身了一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possessed by an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.80,0:00:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你认识Mills警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you know Sheriff Mills.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.41,0:00:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was not my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.71,0:00:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你说得对 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're right - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.85,0:00:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么干掉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we put them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.71,0:00:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚我们喝点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What're we drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.10,0:00:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你们有不到一分钟时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have less than one minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.66,0:00:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不然你们可爱的朋友就要窒息而死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before the very dear friend of yours snuff it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.59,0:00:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,停手吧 Crowley\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call it off,Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.25,0:00:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我看见你崩溃后的样子 Crowley\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw you break down,Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.68,0:00:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我治愈你的过程中 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was trying to cure you,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.20,0:00:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你内心的一部分仍旧有人性\N{\fnArial\fs30}A part of you was human again,maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.85,0:00:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 也许现在还存在 - 废话连篇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Still does exist - Blabla boohoo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.36,0:00:45.53,Note,,0,0,0,,(南达科他 哈特福德)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.81,0:00:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安 Slim\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nighty-night,Slim.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.35,0:02:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.27,0:02:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.56,0:02:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.53,0:02:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.03,0:02:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微休息了一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Resting my head for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.78,0:02:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Kevin怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.42,0:02:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.60,0:02:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他有什么新发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He find anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.31,0:03:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.46,0:03:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,已经4天了 连续没睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}On about four days,no sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.90,0:03:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他看起来比你脸色都差\N{\fnArial\fs30}He looks worse than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.64,0:03:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Crowley呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.49,0:03:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得 他有没有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think he might be lying about the whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.35,0:03:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,在Metatron咒语不可逆这件事上说谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron-spell-being-irreversible-thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.52,0:03:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是Crowley专长吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?Crowley?Lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.29,0:03:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do know one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.17,0:03:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,下次那老混蛋再对人血上瘾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time that junkie's jonesing for a hit of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.09,0:03:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们手里有筹码\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got leverage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.99,0:03:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,说真的 你要个枕头吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously,you wanna a pillow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.34,0:03:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不用 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.50,0:03:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你病了 - 我没病\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're sick - No,I'm not sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.98,0:03:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.96,0:03:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么睡都睡不够的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fell like my battery can't recharge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.36,0:03:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.34,0:03:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 Dean 我是Jody Mills\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,Dean,Jody Mills.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.61,0:03:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mills警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff Mills.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.88,0:03:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 Sam也在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on.Sam's here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.77,0:03:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗨Jody - 嗨Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi,Jody - Hey,Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.92,0:03:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我这儿有个反常的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a bit of an oddball to pitch your direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.47,0:03:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,请说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.23,0:04:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我管辖的一个小镇子 就在苏福尔斯城外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Small town I cover outside the Sioux Falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.36,0:04:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,开始只是失踪了几头牛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only current speak of being occasional cow tipping.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.88,0:04:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,但就在上周\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.29,0:04:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,有4人失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four people go missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.19,0:04:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 为什么觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,so what makes you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.07,0:04:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是我们管的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is our king of weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.15,0:04:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,有个目击证人 说他昨晚看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got witness who says he saw someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.29,0:04:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,有人拎起一辆车 抓走了一个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lift an SUV to nab a girl last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.63,0:04:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.74,0:04:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,没再乱相亲什么的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laying off the blind dates I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.50,0:04:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你别哪壶不开提哪壶 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,you bite your tongue,boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.75,0:04:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.54,0:04:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 所以呢 - 是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So - So.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.20,0:04:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,车就在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Car was right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.22,0:04:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,完全没有头绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ass over a teakettle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.02,0:04:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,通常 如果有人告诉我他看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now,normally,somebody tell me that one guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.15,0:04:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,一个人拎起一辆车 我会直接把他打发走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lift an SUV,I'd tell him to take a flying leap,but.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.33,0:04:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,但在我那些所见所闻之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After what I've seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.26,0:04:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,没有什么是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.92,0:04:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这起事故怎么跟以前的失踪联系起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this matches up the other missing how.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.99,0:04:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,四起绑架 每起绑架的现场都有证据留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,four abductions,strong evidence left every scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.74,0:05:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,字面意义上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.80,0:05:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,第一个受害人是一位牧师\N{\fnArial\fs30}So first vic was a pastor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.37,0:05:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.16,0:05:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他书房的门被撞碎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Door of his study was punched in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.47,0:05:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,然后是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the next two.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.04,0:05:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,一对订了婚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Engaged couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.06,0:05:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,上锁的窗户被大力扯开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locked bedroom window was ripped open.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.44,0:05:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,之后是这个女服务员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we have our waitress here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.78,0:05:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,和一辆被粗暴对待的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the topsy-turvy ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.26,0:05:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,受害人之间有什么联系吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any other connection among them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.58,0:05:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.61,0:05:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都是Good Faith教堂的成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are all members of Good Faith Church here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.06,0:05:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.75,0:05:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我在苏福尔斯城参加的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My church group back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.69,0:05:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那个教堂对此很焦虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Sioux Falls was in a tizzy over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.38,0:05:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.44,0:05:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你不是会去教堂的那种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't peg you for churchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.94,0:05:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 你也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.11,0:05:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,被巫术害到差点在女卫生间的地上窒息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chocked on the lady's room floor because of witchcraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.17,0:05:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,相较之下 这种东西还是挺可靠的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kinda makes a higher power seem relevent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.48,0:05:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Jody 你确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody,you sure you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.20,0:05:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你准备好回来工作了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready to jump back in the fray.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.99,0:05:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这种破事儿总是找上门\N{\fnArial\fs30}This wackadoo stuff keeps coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.81,0:05:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道得越多 就越有心理准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}More I know,better armed I'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.16,0:05:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 现在情况是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,so,we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.01,0:05:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,4个教堂成员失踪 还有超能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missing church folk and super strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.47,0:05:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,也许是天使在找肉身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe angels harvesting vessels.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.94,0:05:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,可能又是个Boyle兄弟携手走光明事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can be a Buddy Boyle type thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.79,0:05:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,等下 你们说天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait,what,angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.31,0:05:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,开玩笑地吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.91,0:05:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,非常严肃认真的说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get your pants on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.00,0:05:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是一群混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}They suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.51,0:05:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你说有目击证人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said there was a witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.13,0:06:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,对 算是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,well,more or less.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.54,0:06:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Slim\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,Slim.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.65,0:06:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我的两个朋友想跟你说说那个失踪女孩儿的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friends here wanna talk you about the missing girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.23,0:06:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Honor\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.05,0:06:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,她叫Honor\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her name was Honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.57,0:06:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,人很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.61,0:06:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,总是给我留一口饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always left me meals.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.24,0:06:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Slim 说说昨晚的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slim,why don't you tell us what you saw last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.81,0:06:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我听到声响\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heard big noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.44,0:06:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,就醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got woke.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.16,0:06:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,发现远处站了一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there somebody over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.02,0:06:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,拎起一辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lifting a car up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.27,0:06:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,像这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.97,0:06:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你看到是谁了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you happen to see who it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.77,0:06:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,太远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.04,0:06:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我看到有光\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I saw a light go off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.74,0:06:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,白光吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A white light.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.81,0:06:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,蓝光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.94,0:06:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,蓝色的火光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blue light fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.80,0:06:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,但不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.14,0:06:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,然后她就\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she was.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.89,0:06:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,她就不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wasn't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.68,0:06:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,还有别的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you think of anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.05,0:06:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.16,0:06:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.16,0:06:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Slim 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slim,thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.39,0:07:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你能来\N{\fnArial\fs30}For your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.13,0:07:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 没白光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,so,no white light.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.81,0:07:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不是天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}No angel.
