Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.64,0:22:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,但你不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.87,0:22:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我最美好的梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the good dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.34,0:22:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿的人都不知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And nobody in Hartford knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.42,0:22:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,难道让我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,what am I supposed to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.21,0:22:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 没错我就是那个艳星 咱们来祈祷吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,yeah,hey,it's me,a porn star,let's prey.
