Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.42,0:23:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.36,0:23:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你的那些本领\N{\fnArial\fs30}The things you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.77,0:23:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,跟玉米卷的那些镜头\N{\fnArial\fs30}The scene with the tacos.
