Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.63,0:25:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,已经出去了一个多小时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been over an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.92,0:25:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.88,0:26:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不得不说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta say.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.14,0:26:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我还挺怀念的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really missed that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.21,0:26:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经怀念很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.62,0:26:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.53,0:26:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing.
