Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.47,0:26:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好渴\N{\fnArial\fs30}So thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.62,0:26:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,一定有出去的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has to be a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.36,0:28:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean 醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean,hey come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.70,0:28:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.99,0:28:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这是哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.68,0:28:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.63,0:28:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.42,0:28:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.00,0:28:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,邻居看见什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neighbours see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.08,0:28:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,蓝光一闪而过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flash blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.38,0:28:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定Dean来过这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure Dean was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.62,0:28:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,非常确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.43,0:28:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,而且 他成功实现计划了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think he crossed someone off his bucket list.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.79,0:28:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们试过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.78,0:28:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,根本没有出路\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.65,0:28:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们会缺氧至死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we gonna run out of air.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.40,0:28:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我不这么觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.97,0:28:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,有人想让咱们一点一点死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody wants us to die nice and slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.40,0:28:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们死了以后都会被带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then it's gonna take us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.38,0:28:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,就像Fred牧师一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like it took pastor Fred.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.16,0:28:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,什么东西带走了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}What took him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.22,0:28:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我们看不清\N{\fnArial\fs30}We couldn't see exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.64,0:28:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那光实在是太刺眼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was so bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.01,0:29:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,就像 就像是火光一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It,it was like it was on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.75,0:29:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.12,0:29:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,处子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Virgins.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.44,0:29:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,火焰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.14,0:29:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,耳熟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sound familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.22,0:29:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Vesta 罗马女灶神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vesta,Roman God of the hearth.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.50,0:29:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,古罗马时期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ancient Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.67,0:29:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,每年都要选出6个处子给这个妞儿当牛做马\N{\fnArial\fs30}6 virgins were dedicated to this chick every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.33,0:29:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的主要指责是照料Vesta的灶火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their main duty was to tend Vesta's hearth.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.43,0:29:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait so.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.20,0:29:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,所以火焰跟童贞有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire is connected to virginity.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.80,0:29:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.14,0:29:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,必须都是处女\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girls had to be pure because.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.40,0:29:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,因为火是纯洁的象征\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire is a symbol of purity.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.59,0:29:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,只要灶火一直不熄灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as the fire was kept to lit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.60,0:29:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,罗马就能迎来丰收\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roman recieved a good harvest.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.22,0:29:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,被选出的处子必须守身30年\N{\fnArial\fs30}The virgins had to stay celibate for 30 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.57,0:29:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他们打破了誓言\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they broke their vows.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.74,0:29:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,就会被活埋\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were burried alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.98,0:29:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.32,0:29:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.27,0:29:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这一切也许都是上帝的意志\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe God wants us down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.41,0:29:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们刚那什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of what we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.30,0:29:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 这可不是上帝干的事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me this is not God's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.50,0:29:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,它个混\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a.
