Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.50,0:30:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,很幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luckily.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.84,0:30:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我还有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep a spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.19,0:30:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,别掉链子啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on,bars.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.44,0:30:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Vesta总是出现在一团蓝色的圣光里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vesta was often enveloped in a blue halo of light.
