Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.18,0:30:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.77,0:30:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam Sammy\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.91,0:30:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- Dean - 嘿 嘿 听我说 我在\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean - Hey,hey,listen to me,I'm.
