Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.32,0:30:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 再说一遍我听不清 - 我们在\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Say it again,I can't hear you - We're.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.40,0:30:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind of.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.06,0:30:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.77,0:30:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,没信号了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lost him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.75,0:30:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.36,0:30:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 这附近有没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a sec,is there some kind of a.
