Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.54,0:30:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我听到了汽笛声\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have sworn I heard a whistle.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.40,0:31:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,别 Neil 别这么干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't,Neil,please,don't.
