Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.61,0:31:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们被恐慌包围着\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're under the gallows.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.33,0:31:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你我都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.20,0:31:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,先从她下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it Honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.51,0:31:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定能救了我们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might save the rest of our necks.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.57,0:31:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你有更好的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you have a better plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.75,0:31:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,或许我还真有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.52,0:31:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,或许我们应该先把你交出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we'll give him you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.69,0:31:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 你不喜欢这个主意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,what you don't like that idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.43,0:31:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那就给我闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.59,0:31:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我查到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.15,0:32:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,一辆8点左右驶出苏福尔斯的火车\N{\fnArial\fs30}8 pm train out of a Sinoux Falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.25,0:32:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,每小时79英里的速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}79 miles an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.60,0:32:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,哈特福德东边5英里是什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's five miles east of Hartford,anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.31,0:32:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,应该都是草场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pasture mostly.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.48,0:32:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.28,0:32:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,老Wimmer农场\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old Wimmer farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.70,0:32:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 拿什么做武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait,anything got a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.76,0:32:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,沾有处子血的橡树枝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oak,stained in virgin blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.75,0:32:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去哪找处子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we gonna get a virgin.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.51,0:32:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是处子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a virgin.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.61,0:32:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我们需要的是真处子 Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we need the real McCoy here Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.71,0:32:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你们需要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need what.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.11,0:32:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.87,0:32:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,就一点点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a dab.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.56,0:32:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,邪教徒才会用血 你们是邪教徒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pagans use blood.Are you pagans.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.19,0:32:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 邪教\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?Pagan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.43,0:32:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不 是为了做一个武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,look it's for a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.39,0:32:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你们就在一个教堂里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are in a House of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.97,0:32:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的邪恶仪式不可能在这里进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your psycho rituals aren't gonna fly here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.73,0:32:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没时间跟你解释了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.85,0:32:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我也没时间跟恶魔崇拜者废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have time for devil worshipers.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.89,0:32:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我要叫警察了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm calling the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.03,0:32:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.70,0:32:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fudge lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.33,0:32:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,擦擦鼻子吧 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wipe your nose,dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.47,0:33:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你也破戒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You broke too huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.71,0:33:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我没有自己想象中的那么坚强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I'm not strong as I thought I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.43,0:34:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,主原谅众生 你自己这么告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}God forgives.You told me that yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.40,0:34:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,早给你说了 他回来抓人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told you,it's back for one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.35,0:34:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在要怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.01,0:34:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该听我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right you should have listened to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.20,0:34:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴 安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shhh!Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.79,0:34:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Jody\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.27,0:34:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.68,0:34:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean 我们来了 马上救你们出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!We're here.We're gonna get you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.85,0:34:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Jody 我找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody I found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.78,0:34:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sammy Sammy\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.06,0:34:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sammy\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.37,0:34:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean 我们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey Dean we are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.98,0:34:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们马上救你们出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.14,0:34:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sammy\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.37,0:34:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你还在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.53,0:34:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.79,0:35:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好了好了 嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now now,shhh.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.58,0:35:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗 你们神就是这么办事儿的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really,this is how Goddess acts.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.31,0:35:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.32,0:35:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我对这方面还不怎么在行 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sort of new to this,but you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.10,0:35:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,堂堂罗马神居然把人活埋在仓库里\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Roman deity burying people alive in a barn.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.91,0:35:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不觉得有点可悲么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sort of pathetic don't you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.90,0:35:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,只有在我开始一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It only got pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.07,0:35:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,做这些的时候才是可悲\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I start having to do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.36,0:35:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,要不是那个从伯利恒来的破烂货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of that hippie from Bethlehem.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.23,0:35:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他出现之前 都是我一人独享处子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before him,they practically threw virgins at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.06,0:35:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,然后现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.59,0:35:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他们放任你的灶火不管 把你抛在了脑后\N{\fnArial\fs30}They let your fire go out and they forget about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.75,0:35:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.86,0:35:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,总是排在第二名做Lindsay Lohan\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sucks to be Lindsay Lohan.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.37,0:35:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,可不好受 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.44,0:35:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,实际上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.08,0:35:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我想通了 如果反抗不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figure it if you can't beat'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.46,0:35:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那就加入他们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Join them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.79,0:36:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊 我学会了变通\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right,I adapted.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.48,0:36:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我学会了祷告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I chew on the cud of prayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.15,0:36:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,真见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heck.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.41,0:36:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我甚至有了这样的毛衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I even got a sweater set.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.46,0:36:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,有螺丝刀么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screwdriver,anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.66,0:36:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.45,0:36:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,急救箱里找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the first-aid kit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.76,0:36:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,过去人们会争先恐后的为我守身如玉\N{\fnArial\fs30}They use to beg to stay pure for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.85,0:36:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 轮到我拖着她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now,I have to drag them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.54,0:36:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,挣扎着尖叫着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kicking and screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.46,0:36:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他们甚至不是真正的处子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they're not even real virgins.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.28,0:36:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是新生的处子\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are born-again.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.14,0:36:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你还说我可悲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk about pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.44,0:36:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是个典型的阶下囚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,you are a charity case.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.90,0:37:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,错了 我的小心肝 这可不是施舍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no sweet heart.This isn't charity.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.89,0:37:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是拿了我该得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take what I deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.82,0:37:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那些荡妇们葬身之时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When those trollops are about to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.13,0:37:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,肉体浸染着鲜美的恐惧感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soaked in their juicy fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.99,0:37:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我会吃掉她们的肝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I eat their livers.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.75,0:37:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,因为这是她们身上唯一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that's the only part of them still working to.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.14,0:37:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,还在起净化作用的部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Purify the body that they've trashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.38,0:37:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我一般喜欢让猎物变得虚弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now normally I'd like them weaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.62,0:37:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,但我得为猎人破个例 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But let's just call this a hunter's exception shall we.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.73,0:37:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.61,0:37:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我们神的作风\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how I goddess acts.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.68,0:37:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.87,0:38:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.25,0:38:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.27,0:38:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你的肝 都坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your liver,it's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.76,0:38:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 你的身体已经从里面坏掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dear boy,you're all duct tape and safety pins inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.90,0:38:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么还能活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.06,0:38:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我错过了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.95,0:38:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,要走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heading out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.29,0:38:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 跟你们说过别到处惹麻烦 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,I tell you boys stay out of trouble but.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.41,0:38:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,说了也没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.73,0:38:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你救我出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for bailing me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.22,0:38:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我能说什么好呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.43,0:39:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经救顺手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting the hang of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.32,0:39:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,慢点开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drive safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.22,0:39:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.48,0:39:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不用给我开门什么的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get the door for me or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.44,0:39:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.81,0:39:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我真的有什么问题怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if there is something wrong with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.99,0:39:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,特别严重的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something really wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.89,0:39:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你只是累坏了 你需要休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just crapped out man.You need some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.83,0:39:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不 比这更严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}No it's more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.14,0:39:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Vesta说我只是行尸走肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean Vesta said I was practically dead inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.82,0:39:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么 她现在是你的闺蜜了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh and she's in the circle of trust now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.10,0:39:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,她有必要说谎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would she lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.07,0:39:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定是那些试炼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's probably the trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.34,0:39:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好么 就像一种 后遗症\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok?That was sort of...you know,after effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.82,0:39:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,就像感冒之后的后遗症\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like you're bouncing back of a flu here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.67,0:39:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,当时你全身都发着不正常的红光\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean you were glowing with freaking trial juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.06,0:39:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.18,0:39:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不然还能是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well what else would it be.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.99,0:39:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么一定会有别的什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does it have to be something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.38,0:39:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,总是有别的东西不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's always something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.88,0:39:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们总是绞尽脑汁想出一个其他解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're always scraping to find some other explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.48,0:39:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,有可能问题就是我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well maybe it is just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.51,0:39:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不要这样Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.42,0:40:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在一团糟 Dean你也知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a mess Dean and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.75,0:40:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候我就是觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes I feel like.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.35,0:40:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我可能永远都不会好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I'll never ganna actually be alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.81,0:40:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你会好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.41,0:40:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不管是什么问题我们都能解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}What ever it is we'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.63,0:40:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,或许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.61,0:40:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我本来就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the way I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.84,0:40:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.85,0:40:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我没法让你继续这样下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't let you put this on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.79,0:40:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.47,0:40:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是真的你Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not you Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.32,0:40:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我 就不会告诉他 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't do that,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.18,0:40:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他应该知道真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}He deserve to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.15,0:40:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你的弟弟还没准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother is not ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.64,0:40:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他排斥我他肯定挺不过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he reject me he will not make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.93,0:40:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼Zeke我们还要这样玩捉迷藏玩多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn Zeke how much longer we have to keep playing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.15,0:40:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不会很久了 我向你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not much longer I promise you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.57,0:40:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.98,0:40:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.77,0:41:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 什么不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}What what's not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.34,0:41:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么 我是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing I just...I meant that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.90,0:41:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,如果有什么不对 也不是你的不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there is something wrong,it's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.81,0:41:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会解决的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.30,0:41:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你要有点信心Sammy\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to have a little faith Sammy
